   <pdf:Keywords>Technical: HTML5 | CSS3 | JavaScript | ReactJS | SpringBoot | Java  
Accessibility - related : WCAG 2.1 Standards | Inclusive Design | User-Centric Design Thinking | ARIA Roles | Assistive Technology
