   <rms:rms_education_0_qualification>Bachelor's in Technology (Electronics and Communication Engineering)</rms:rms_education_0_qualification>
   <rms:rms_education_count>1</rms:rms_education_count>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_company>Tata Consultancy Services</rms:rms_experience_0_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>June 2023</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>1685577600</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>Present</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Led design, development, and release planning of full-stack features, supporting multiple production releases per quarter.
Spearheaded architecture enhancements of core backend modules, improving system latency by 25% and increasing platform stability and scalability.
Directed the release planning and deployment coordination for further WCAG implementation in the product, supporting multiple production releases per quarter with minimal post-release issues, directly impacting the user experience for students with blindness, low vision, and hearing impairments.
Mentored and guided 8 junior engineers, supporting on-boarding, code reviews, and technical upskilling to ensure high-quality delivery of accessible content. Reduced accessibility-related defects in production by 30% through rigorous QA steps.
Improved release quality by strengthening pre-release validation, resulting in a reduction in post-release defects by ~30%.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_location>Hyderabad, India</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_role>Engineering Team Lead â€“ Inclusive Product Development</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_company>Tata Consultancy Services</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>August 2021</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1627776000</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>June 2023</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1685577600</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Re-architected legacy frontend components using modern JavaScript and ReactJS, improving maintainability and user experience.
Single-handedly drove the accessibility modernization of a legacy web-application by re-architecting the front-end structure, enabling sustainable support for assistive technologies and inclusive user interactions. 
Worked closely with QA and DevOps teams to support continuous integration, deployment, and production stability.
Directed cross-functional delivery outcomes for the accessibility project over 18 months, achieving  a 97% on-time launch rate while maintaining WCAG 2.1 compliance.
Managed accessibility review process for 12+ major releases over 18 months, utilizing Axe and Wave tools to identify and remedy an average of 35 accessibility issues per deployment, resulting in a 60% reduction in post-release defects and directly supporting ongoing WCAG 2.1 compliance initiatives.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_location>Hyderabad, Telangana</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_role>Senior Product Engineer (Accessibility &amp; Inclusive Design)</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_company>Tata Consultancy Services</rms:rms_experience_2_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>April 2017</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>1491004800</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>August 2021</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>1627776000</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_description>Functioned as a key contributor to  TCS iON - A transformational cloud-based â€œphygitalâ€ platform that digitizes learning, assessments, exam administration, skilling, and institutional operations for educational institutions, boards, and enterprises.
Led end-to-end delivery of features across the SDLC, from requirement analysis to deployment and post-release monitoring.
Owned development and production support for critical modules of TCS iON, supporting large-scale users across reputed Indian and International Institutions.</rms:rms_experience_2_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_location>Hyderabad, Telangana</rms:rms_experience_2_location>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_role>Software Development Engineer</rms:rms_experience_2_role>
