   <rms:rms_skill_0_category>Technical</rms:rms_skill_0_category>
   <rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>HTML5 | CSS3 | JavaScript | ReactJS | SpringBoot | Java  
Accessibility - related : WCAG 2.1 Standards | Inclusive Design | User-Centric Design Thinking | ARIA Roles | Assistive Technology
Interpersonal : Technical Consulting | Change Management | SDLC Governance | Team Management | Data-Informed Decision Making | Product Development</rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>
   <rms:rms_skill_count>1</rms:rms_skill_count>
   <rms:rms_summary>Java Full Stack Developer with 8+ years of experience in designing, developing, and scaling enterprise-grade web applications using Java, Spring Boot, ReactJS, and modern web technologies. Strong expertise across backend services, REST APIs, front-end development, and end-to-end SDLC ownership. Proven experience leading teams, optimizing system performance, and delivering high-quality, scalable solutions used by millions of users. Accessibility and inclusive design experience adds depth to building robust, user-centric applications.</rms:rms_summary>
